  "title": "Erdős Problem #675",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "We say that $A\\subset \\mathbb{N}$ has the translation property if, for every $n$, there exists some integer $t_n\\geq 1$ such that, for all $1\\leq a\\leq n$, $ a\\in A\\quad\\textrm{ if and only if }\\quad a+t_n\\in A. $ {UL}",
